, funding, reconciliation, tax lots, monitoring fan-out. **MVP recommendation: 1 paper wallet + 1 live hot wallet.** Scale wallets only with operational runbooks.

**“Up to 5% of supply”:** Treat as a **hard concentration risk**, never a default. Cap by: `% of pool depth you can exit into with ≤X% slippage`, `% of portfolio`, max notional, and time-to-exit under stress. Most early meme books should target **far below** 5%.

---

## 4. Phased roadmap

### Phase 0 — Foundations (1–2 weeks)
- Repo, env, secrets manager, Postgres schema, CI
- Alchemy RPC + archive; Blockscout client
- Registry tables for protocols/launchpads (manual seed: Pons, Uniswap, Pools.trade TBD addresses)
- Evidence/citation model
- Kill switch stub + audit log

**Exit:** Can pull latest blocks, decode ERC-20 + Uniswap pool-created events, store with timestamps.

### Phase 1 — Research dashboard (MVP product)
- Ingest new pools/tokens from verified factories
- Contract risk static checks (owner, mint, pause, blacklist, tax heuristics, proxy)
- Deployer provenance (funding tx, prior deploys) with confidence labels
- Manual watchlist of ≤50 trader wallets
- Report UI: Opportunity / Risk / Confidence + sources
- **No execution**

**Exit:** You use dashboard daily; false-positive rate measured.

### Phase 2 — Live alerts
- Push alerts (Telegram/email) on: new launch in filters, watched-wallet buy in filters, critical risk flags
- Hourly broad research jobs + **live** listeners for deployments, liquidity adds, launches, watched txs
- Deduping + alert fatigue controls

**Exit:** Alert precision tracked; on-call tolerable.

### Phase 3 — Paper trading
- Simulated fills using quotes + latency model + fee/tax assumptions
- Approval workflow rehearsed (propose → approve → revalidate → “virtual” fill)
- Sell-rule engine in dry-run
- Score calibration vs subsequent 1h/24h/7d outcomes (**no** claim of alpha yet)

**Exit:** Written post-mortem on 50+ paper trades; known failure modes.

### Phase 4 — Approved purchases + automated sells
- Real signer + executor with simulation gate
- Explicit human approval with expiry and material-change invalidation
- Pre-approved TP / SL / trailing / time / emergency exits
- Daily loss limits, exposure caps, stale-data checks, duplicate-order prevention

**Exit:** Limited live capital; kill switch tested; audit trail complete.

### Phase 5 — (Optional) Autonomy experiments
- Only after Phase 4 metrics; still policy-bounded; never keys in LLM

---

## 5. Database schema (proposed)

```sql
-- Core entities (simplified)

CREATE TABLE protocols (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  name TEXT NOT NULL,
  category TEXT NOT NULL, -- launchpad|dex|lending|perps|bridge|other
  chain_id INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 4663,
  website_url TEXT,
  docs_url TEXT,
  github_url TEXT,
  x_handle TEXT,
  status TEXT NOT NULL, -- active|paused|defunct|unknown
  first_seen_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
  metadata JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT '{}',
  UNIQUE (chain_id, name)
);

CREATE TABLE contracts (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  chain_id INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 4663,
  address BYTEA NOT NULL,
  kind TEXT NOT NULL, -- token|factory|pair|router|deployer_eoa|proxy|other
  protocol_id UUID REFERENCES protocols(id),
  verified_source BOOLEAN,
  is_proxy BOOLEAN,
  implementation_address BYTEA,
  first_seen_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
  provenance_confidence TEXT NOT NULL, -- verified|corroborated|tentative|unknown
  UNIQUE (chain_id, address)
);

CREATE TABLE tokens (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  contract_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES contracts(id),
  symbol TEXT,
  name TEXT,
  decimals INT,
  total_supply NUMERIC,
  launchpad_id UUID REFERENCES protocols(id),
  token_class TEXT, -- meme|utility|rwa|stable|unknown
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
  brokerage_listed BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,
  on_chain_tradable BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE
);

CREATE TABLE evidence (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  subject_type TEXT NOT NULL, -- token|contract|protocol|wallet|report
  subject_id UUID NOT NULL,
  source_type TEXT NOT NULL, -- rpc|explorer|website|github|x|docs|manual
  source_url TEXT,
  observed_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
  collected_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),
  claim TEXT NOT NULL,
  raw_ref JSONB, -- tx hash, block, snapshot id, etc.
  trust TEXT NOT NULL -- primary_onchain|official_docs|corroborated|unverified_social
);

CREATE TABLE wallets (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  chain_id INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 4663,
  address BYTEA NOT NULL,
  label TEXT,
  watchlist BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,
  trader_score JSONB, -- performance metrics + caveats
  UNIQUE (chain_id, address)
);

CREATE TABLE wallet_events (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  wallet_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES wallets(id),
  tx_hash BYTEA NOT NULL,
  block_number BIGINT NOT NULL,
  event_type TEXT NOT NULL, -- buy|sell|transfer_in|transfer_out|add_liq|remove_liq
  token_id UUID REFERENCES tokens(id),
  amount NUMERIC,
  estimated_value_usd NUMERIC,
  estimated_mcap_usd NUMERIC,
  observed_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL
);

CREATE TABLE scores (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  token_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES tokens(id),
  framework TEXT NOT NULL, -- meme|utility
  opportunity NUMERIC NOT NULL, -- 0..100
  risk NUMERIC NOT NULL,
  evidence_confidence NUMERIC NOT NULL,
  rejected BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,
  rejection_reasons TEXT[],
  weights JSONB NOT NULL,
  model_version TEXT NOT NULL,
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()
);

CREATE TABLE reports (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  token_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES tokens(id),
  score_id UUID REFERENCES scores(id),
  summary TEXT NOT NULL,
  body_md TEXT NOT NULL,
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()
);

CREATE TABLE purchase_proposals (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  token_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES tokens(id),
  report_id UUID REFERENCES reports(id),
  contract_address BYTEA NOT NULL,
  chain_id INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 4663,
  size_base NUMERIC NOT NULL, -- spend amount in quote asset
  quote_asset TEXT NOT NULL, -- ETH|USDG|...
  max_slippage_bps INT NOT NULL,
  deadline_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
  exit_rules JSONB NOT NULL,
  status TEXT NOT NULL, -- pending|approved|rejected|expired|executed|invalidated
  approved_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
  approval_expires_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
  material_snapshot JSONB NOT NULL -- price, liq, tax flags at proposal time
);

CREATE TABLE orders (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  proposal_id UUID REFERENCES purchase_proposals(id),
  side TEXT NOT NULL, -- buy|sell
  status TEXT NOT NULL,
  tx_hash BYTEA,
  simulated_ok BOOLEAN,
  error TE